# This repository does not use Git LFS.
#
# It used to: 100 FastText n-gram tables (~186 GB) and 625 per-trial classifier
# weights (~6.4 GB) were tracked via LFS. Both are gone — the embeddings are now
# six global models totalling 38 MB (artifacts/embeddings/), and the per-trial
# weights are no longer shipped because every downstream artifact reads the
# probability matrices (probs_*.npz) and meta.json instead, which are small.
#
# The two deployed models are xz-compressed at save time, which puts both under
# GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit:
#   artifacts/final_model.pkl      173 MB -> 24 MB
#   artifacts/final_model_v2.pkl   144 MB -> 21 MB
# joblib.load() auto-detects the wrapper, so no inference code changes.
